{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, -1)
>>
Rule 16 (LU_data's shape's last dimension must be greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, -1) > 0
>>
Rule 27 (LU_pivots must be 1D tensor)
{v_1: tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1
